1601277661846_5428982906936699612_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rqtd4e9zmu4Q7kNvwFFM6ov&_nc_oc=AdppczfiOTmSgEUiA1c2XbSVdVFEDfb3KduX46QfFhDxx1qJsxiQUOV8pUn2TnqkzI0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSn4k6Qu8wZ7ykd54_TuTiCfbNq41XlsSPkA5ji-Zi5tw&oe=6B09C3AF"}, {"file_name": "Screengrabs_4.png", "id": "507102677251409", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75395590_507102680584742_7420227356861752672_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QeYwyIWlqBkQ7kNvwE5Y7wu&_nc_oc=Adrxu9-4Ui1HJp-Opy6f7_SXmCZCygtExDQorKxEq4QdEYtpeMUjskiUBCQbQB00iYo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS30hAYVk0ffG7SeUrjrknKKEA6mBFne-drg6WuXdNFwA&oe=6B09C2A2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Curatours", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Visitors can access tours of museums around the world from their desktops, phones or VR headsets. In VR it's an incredibly immersive experience and on other devices it's a bit like a cross between a Zoom Call and playing a game. \n\nYou can choose from three types of tour:\n \nSelf-guided tours can happen at anytime, just login and go exploring!\n \nPre-recorded tours are similar to a self-guided tour only at points a guide will appear to tell you something about that place or the artefact you\u2019re near. It\u2019s a bit like a 3D audio guide.\n \nLive-guided tours put you in a museum or gallery with an expert so you can talk to them and ask questions. To get a live-guided tour you will need to book on to one of the timeslots available. ", "short_description": "Visit art exhibitions and museums with friends and family. Everyone can explore and experience the tours using a either a PC, tablet, smartphone or virtual reality headset."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.coopinnovations.co.uk/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_se